        "sha": "f2163b45a50d5a4fa2b80ae030ae866c3341a055"
      },
      "body": "GoreeCloud Redirector is now canonically maintained in `GoreeCloud/goreecloud-firefox-extensions` under `extensions/redirector/`.\n\nThis change marks the standalone repository as a legacy migration source pending provenance/history preservation and retirement, and points the add-on homepage to the canonical Firefox source. It does not change the Redirector product identity, Firefox add-on ID, or historically accepted Stable 0.2.0 release status.",
      "formerUrl": "https://github.com/GoreeCloud/goreecloud-redirector/pull/2"
    },
    {
      "number": 1,
      "title": "Build GoreeCloud Redirector v0.2.0 release candidate",
      "state": "closed",
      "draft": false,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-17T14:53:44Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-17T14:56:27Z",
      "closedAt": "2026-08-17T14:56:27Z",
      "mergedAt": "2026-08-17T14:56:27Z",
      "mergeCommitSha": "92220cd5c796d00ad4fa1a81fcfd74b6c73c85cd",
      "head": {
        "ref": "agent/stable-foundation",
        "sha": "d4c8bd249a7fb3930851b06730db483beb3ebd9d"
      },
      "base": {
        "ref": "main",
        "sha": "7e48786e4e7b94ccb60de41cf2313ea3a299b1b1"
      },
      "body": "## Summary\n\nEstablishes the first complete GoreeCloud Redirector source foundation in its canonical repository.\n\n## Changes\n\n- preserves the accepted Google Keep → GoreeCloud Memos redirect\n- adds the GoreeCloud Redirector product icon in SVG and raster sizes\n- aligns popup and settings surfaces with Glaze UI 1.0.0\n- adds custom redirect management with per-source optional host permissions\n- adds duplicate-source and redirect-loop validation\n- keeps the built-in required host permission limited to `https://keep.google.com/*`\n- declares no Firefox data collection\n- adds privacy and security documentation\n- adds source validation and exact-revision GitHub Actions CI\n- adds credential-safe Mozilla unlisted-signing documentation and helper\n\n## Validation completed before publication\n\n- `python3 scripts/validate.py`\n- `node --check popup.js`\n- `node --check options.js`\n- source archive structure verification\n- Git tree verification of all 25 prepared source files and expected icon byte sizes\n- functional v0.1.0 Firefox acceptance confirmed for Google Keep → GoreeCloud Memos\n\n## Release status\n\nThis is a source and unsigned-package release candidate. Stable persistent installation remains gated on Mozilla signing and acceptance testing of the signed XPI after Firefox restart.\n",
      "formerUrl": "https://github.com/GoreeCloud/goreecloud-redirector/pull/1"
    }
